<% content_for :title, "Impulsivity Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / IMPULSIVITY
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>BEFORE</span>
        <span>“FUCK IT”</span>
        <span>TAKES OVER.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY PLAN FOR THE SPACE BETWEEN THE URGE AND THE ACTION.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY PATTERN</p>
      <h2>HOW FAST<br>DOES IT HAPPEN?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about your impulsive drinking pattern and the moments before acting.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / THE MOMENT BEFORE</p>
      <h2>CATCH THE<br>SALES PITCH.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY TRIGGERS</h3>
          <p>[Write the situations and feelings that precede impulsive drinking.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY GO-TO EXCUSES</h3>
          <p>[Write the phrases you use to give yourself permission.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / MY INTERRUPTION PLAN</p>
      <h2>PUT SOMETHING<br>IN BETWEEN.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY PAUSE</h3>
          <p>[Write your specific plan for delaying action.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY BARRIERS</h3>
          <p>[Write the practical barriers you choose to put between yourself and alcohol.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY ALTERNATIVE ACTION</h3>
          <p>[Write what you will do during the pause.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY CHECK-IN PERSON</h3>
          <p>[Write who you will contact before acting and your backup.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / IF THE URGE KEEPS BUILDING</p>
      <h2>WHAT’S MY<br>NEXT MOVE?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write your next level of support, relevant care instructions, and safety steps.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>